  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investing in Women Fund (Investment Capital)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bill 2 funding for Investing in Women (IW) Fund investments. As part of Investing in Women a gender investment window is established under Australian Development Investments (ADI). The ADI Trust Deed has been amended to allow DFAT to establish a dedicated gender window &#x2013; the Investing in Women Fund (IW Fund). Consistent with ADI&#x2019;s established mandate, the IW fund will make investments to support a portfolio of &#x2018;women-supporting businesses&#x2019; (primary objective) in Southeast Asia. The IW Fund partners will work with their portfolio SMEs to improve the foundations for a fair and equitable workplace for women (secondary objective).</narrative>
  </description>
